   - Use Rails' strong parameters to prevent mass assignment vulnerabilities. Ensure that only permitted attributes are allowed for mass assignment in controller actions:
     ```ruby
     def entry_params
       params.require(:entry).permit(:title, :content, :createdBy)
     end
     ```

